{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2023-05-11 20:00:00', 'title': 'CITI LIBOR TRANSITION UPDATE', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ON NOVEMBER 14, 2022, ICE BENCHMARK ADMINISTRATION (“IBA”), THE PUBLISHER OF THE USD LIBOR ICE SWAP RATE, ANNOUNCED THAT IT INTENDS TO CEASE PUBLICATION OF ALL ICE SWAP RATE SETTINGS BASED ON USD LIBOR AFTER JUNE 30, 2023 (THE "CESSATION DATE"). THIS ANNOUNCEMENT FOLLOWS THE ANNOUNCEMENT BY THE UK FINANCIAL CONDUCT AUTHORITY ON MARCH 5, 2021, THAT ALL USD LIBOR SETTINGS WILL EITHER CEASE OR NO LONGER BE REPRESENTATIVE AFTER THE CESSATION DATE. THE USD LIBOR ICE SWAP R.'}